OL,3,GNEWSASecond murder charge brought over
OL,4,Afatal attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of man in
OL,8,FLeeds.
OL,10,FRaheim Jackson, 38, died after he was
OL,11,Fattacked by a group of men in Hedley
OL,12,FChase, New Wortley, on 24 October.
OL,14,FWest Yorkshire Police said 28-year-old
OL,15,FLouis Jolaoso, of Sowod Street, Leeds,
OL,16,Fhad been charged with his murder and is
OL,17,Fdue to appear at Leeds Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt later.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
